Overview
CareFlow is a clinical pathway process-mining project that studies how patients move through hospital activities. Using event-log data, the project examines activity sequences, transition frequency, and the time between consecutive events.

The workflow combines Python and PM4Py for process analysis with Google BigQuery and dbt for cloud-based data preparation. Power BI dashboard development is the next planned stage for communicating the findings through interactive visuals.
Project Goals
- Map common patient pathways through hospital activities.
- Analyze directly-follows transitions and their frequency.
- Calculate time intervals between consecutive events.
- Establish a tested, repeatable data-transformation workflow.
- Prepare curated data for an interactive BI dashboard.
