Planned Power BI Dashboard
The BI layer is planned to use two curated tables:
- patient_summary — case-level metrics and patient pathway summaries, based on the final model definition.
- mart_transition — activity-to-next-activity metrics, including counts and waiting-time measures.
Potential visuals include KPI cards, transition-frequency charts, average-versus-median waiting-time comparisons, and patient pathway views supported by the final data.
